<view class="page">
  <nav-bar title="画一件东西"></nav-bar>
  <scroll-view class="content" scroll-y>
    <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="page-state"><view class="loading-orbit"></view><text>正在铺开画纸…</text></view>
    <view wx:elif="{{error && !hasInk}}" class="page-state"><text>{{error}}</text><view class="primary-action" style="width:240rpx;flex:none;" bindtap="onRetryLoad">重新加载</view></view>
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="quota-line"><text>今天还可以许愿 {{remaining}} 次</text><text>固定额度，不累积</text></view>
      <view class="canvas-card">
        <canvas canvas-id="decorCanvas" class="decor-canvas" disable-scroll bindtouchstart="onDrawStart" bindtouchmove="onDrawMove" bindtouchend="onDrawEnd" bindtouchcancel="onDrawEnd"></canvas>
        <text wx:if="{{!hasInk}}" class="canvas-placeholder">画一件想放进房间的小家具或装饰</text>
      </view>
      <text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-text">{{error}}</text>
      <view wx:if="{{generating}}" class="magic-state"><view class="magic-orbit"></view><text>ta 正在用魔法理解你的画…</text></view>
      <view wx:elif="{{result}}" class="result-card"><view class="result-placeholder">{{result.label}}</view><text>这是尺寸稳定的转译占位层，正式透明 PNG 接入后会自动替换。</text></view>
      <view class="toolbar"><view class="secondary-action" bindtap="onClear">清空画纸</view><view class="primary-action {{generating || remaining <= 0 ? 'primary-action--busy' : ''}}" bindtap="onGenerate">{{generating ? '正在画…' : (remaining <= 0 ? '今天的许愿次数用完了' : '让 ta 帮我画')}}</view></view>
      <view class="saved-section"><text class="saved-title">已经留在房间里的画</text><view wx:if="{{decorations.length}}" class="saved-list"><view wx:for="{{decorations}}" wx:key="id" class="saved-item">{{item.label}}</view></view><text wx:else class="saved-empty">这里还没有画好的东西。</text></view>
    </block>
  </scroll-view>
</view>
